  "rows": [
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ところで、悠介アニさんはどうしたんだ？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "黒野 玄武"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_03_g:step-3:text",
        "step_id": 3,
        "step_index": 2,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_03_g",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_03_g.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 46,
          "target_step_index": 2
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "あー……ちょっと今は、別行動してるんだ。\n大丈夫、すぐに合流するから。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "蒼井 享介"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_03_g:step-6:text",
        "step_id": 6,
        "step_index": 5,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_03_g",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_03_g.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 46,
          "target_step_index": 5
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ならよかったぜ！　にしても、\n初っ端から2人はすごかったよなぁっ！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "紅井 朱雀"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_03_g:step-9:text",
        "step_id": 9,
        "step_index": 8,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_03_g",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_03_g.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 46,
          "target_step_index": 8
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "他のヤツらをどんどん追い越して、\n真っ先に3周走りきっちまうんだもんな！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "紅井 朱雀"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_03_g:step-10:text",
        "step_id": 10,
        "step_index": 9,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_03_g",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_03_g.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 46,
          "target_step_index": 9
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "え……？　3周？　2周じゃなくて？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "蒼井 享介"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_03_g:step-14:text",
        "step_id": 14,
        "step_index": 13,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_03_g",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_03_g.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 46,
          "target_step_index": 13
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "いや、3周だったはずだ。\nって、享介アニさん、まさか……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "黒野 玄武"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_03_g:step-17:text",
        "step_id": 17,
        "step_index": 16,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_03_g",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_03_g.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 46,
          "target_step_index": 16
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "俺たち……2周しか走ってない。でも、\nもらった資料には確かに2周って書いてあったんだ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "蒼井 享介"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_03_g:step-20:text",
        "step_id": 20,
        "step_index": 19,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_03_g",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_03_g.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 46,
          "target_step_index": 19
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "マ、マジかよ！？\n二人が速すぎて、誰も気づいてなかったぜ！？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "紅井 朱雀"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_03_g:step-23:text",
        "step_id": 23,
        "step_index": 22,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_03_g",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_03_g.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 46,
          "target_step_index": 22
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "●●●●●●●●●●番長さんは、\n何も言ってなかったのか？",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "黒野 玄武"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_03_g:step-24:text",
        "step_id": 24,
        "step_index": 23,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_03_g",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_03_g.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 46,
          "target_step_index": 23
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "言ってなかった。俺たちだけ、\n間違ったルールを渡されてたのかもしれない。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "蒼井 享介"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_03_g:step-27:text",
        "step_id": 27,
        "step_index": 26,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_03_g",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_03_g.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 46,
          "target_step_index": 26
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "そいつは大変だ！　……玄武！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "紅井 朱雀"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_03_g:step-30:text",
        "step_id": 30,
        "step_index": 29,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_03_g",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_03_g.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 46,
          "target_step_index": 29
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ああ。とにかく番長さんに、\nこのことを伝えに行こう！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "黒野 玄武"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_03_g:step-31:text",
        "step_id": 31,
        "step_index": 30,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_03_g",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_03_g.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 46,
          "target_step_index": 30
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "2人とも、ありがとう。よろしくね。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "蒼井 享介"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_03_g:step-34:text",
        "step_id": 34,
        "step_index": 33,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_03_g",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_03_g.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 46,
          "target_step_index": 33
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "（……。どうしよう……）",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "蒼井 享介"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_03_g:step-41:text",
        "step_id": 41,
        "step_index": 40,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_03_g",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_03_g.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 46,
          "target_step_index": 40
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "（悠介は、このことに気づいてるのか？\nもし俺が、悠介だったら……）",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "蒼井 享介"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_03_g:step-42:text",
        "step_id": 42,
        "step_index": 41,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_03_g",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_03_g.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 46,
          "target_step_index": 41
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "（ミスを無視して、このままゴールに向かう？\nそれとも1位を捨てて、会場に戻る……？）",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "蒼井 享介"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_03_g:step-43:text",
        "step_id": 43,
        "step_index": 42,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_03_g",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_03_g.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 46,
          "target_step_index": 42
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "「悠介なら」、じゃない。\nいつまでも、悠介のせいにしちゃ駄目なんだ。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "蒼井 享介"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_03_g:step-45:text",
        "step_id": 45,
        "step_index": 44,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_03_g",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_03_g.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 46,
          "target_step_index": 44
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ちゃんと……進む道を、自分で決めるんだ！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "蒼井 享介"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
